#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.split.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.split"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:1
#: pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:35
msgid "Split strings around given separator/delimiter."
msgstr "围绕给定分隔符拆分字符串。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:3
msgid ""
"Splits the string in the Series/Index from the beginning, at the "
"specified delimiter string."
msgstr "从开头开始拆分 Series/Index 中的字符串，使用指定的分隔符字符串。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:6
msgid ""
"String or regular expression to split on. If not specified, split on "
"whitespace."
msgstr "用于拆分的字符串或正则表达式。如果没有指定，则按空白字符拆分。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:9
msgid ""
"Limit number of splits in output. ``None``, 0 and -1 will be interpreted "
"as return all splits."
msgstr "限制输出中的拆分数。``None``、0 和 -1 将被解释为返回所有拆分。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:12
msgid ""
"Expand the split strings into separate columns.  - If ``True``, return "
"DataFrame/MultiIndex expanding dimensionality. - If ``False``, return "
"Series/Index, containing lists of strings."
msgstr ""
"将拆分后的字符串扩展到单独列中。- 如果为 ``True``，返回 DataFrame/"
"MultiIndex 扩展维度。- 如果为 ``False``，返回 Series/Index，包含字符串"
"列表。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:17
msgid ""
"Determines if the passed-in pattern is a regular expression:  - If "
"``True``, assumes the passed-in pattern is a regular expression - If "
"``False``, treats the pattern as a literal string. - If ``None`` and "
"`pat` length is 1, treats `pat` as a literal string. - If ``None`` and "
"`pat` length is not 1, treats `pat` as a regular   expression. - Cannot "
"be set to False if `pat` is a compiled regex"
msgstr "确定传入的模式是否为正则表达式：- 如果 ``True``，假设传入的模式是正则表达式 - 如果 ``False``，将模式视为字面字符串。- 如果 ``None`` 且 `pat` 长度为 1，将 `pat` 视为字面字符串。- 如果 ``None`` 且 `pat` 长度不为 1，将 `pat` 视为正则表达式。- 如果 `pat` 是已编译的正则表达式，则不能设置为 False"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:17
msgid "Determines if the passed-in pattern is a regular expression:"
msgstr "确定传入的模式是否为正则表达式："

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:19
msgid "If ``True``, assumes the passed-in pattern is a regular expression"
msgstr "如果为 ``True``，假设传入的模式是正则表达式"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:20
msgid "If ``False``, treats the pattern as a literal string."
msgstr "如果为 ``False``，将模式视为字面字符串。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:21
msgid "If ``None`` and `pat` length is 1, treats `pat` as a literal string."
msgstr "如果为 ``None`` 且 `pat` 长度为 1，将 `pat` 视为字面字符串。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:22
msgid ""
"If ``None`` and `pat` length is not 1, treats `pat` as a regular "
"expression."
msgstr "如果为 ``None`` 且 `pat` 长度不为 1，将 `pat` 视为正则表达式。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:24
msgid "Cannot be set to False if `pat` is a compiled regex"
msgstr "如果 `pat` 是编译的正则表达式，则不能设置为 False"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:27
msgid "Type matches caller unless ``expand=True`` (see Notes)."
msgstr "类型匹配调用者，除非 ``expand=True``（参见注释）。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split
msgid "抛出"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:30
msgid "* if `regex` is False and `pat` is a compiled regex"
msgstr "* 如果 `regex` 为 False 且 `pat` 是已编译的正则表达式"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:30
msgid "if `regex` is False and `pat` is a compiled regex"
msgstr "如果 `regex` 为 False 且 `pat` 是编译的正则表达式"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:34
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.str.split`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:37
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.str.rsplit`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:38
msgid "Splits string around given separator/delimiter, starting from the right."
msgstr "从右侧开始，围绕给定分隔符拆分字符串。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:40
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.str.join`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:41
msgid ""
"Join lists contained as elements in the Series/Index with passed "
"delimiter."
msgstr "使用传递的分隔符连接 Series/Index 中作为元素包含的列表。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:43
msgid ":py:obj:`str.split`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:44
msgid "Standard library version for split."
msgstr "标准库版本的拆分。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:46
msgid ":py:obj:`str.rsplit`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:47
msgid "Standard library version for rsplit."
msgstr "标准库版本的右拆分。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:50
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:51
msgid "The handling of the `n` keyword depends on the number of found splits:"
msgstr "`n` 关键字的处理取决于找到的拆分数："

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:53
msgid "If found splits > `n`,  make first `n` splits only"
msgstr "如果找到的拆分数 > `n`，仅进行前 `n` 次拆分"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:54
msgid "If found splits <= `n`, make all splits"
msgstr "如果找到的拆分数 <= `n`，进行所有拆分"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:55
msgid ""
"If for a certain row the number of found splits < `n`, append `None` for "
"padding up to `n` if ``expand=True``"
msgstr ""
"如果对于某一行找到的拆分数 < `n`，如果 ``expand=True``，则追加 `None` "
"填充至 `n`"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:58
msgid ""
"If using ``expand=True``, Series and Index callers return DataFrame and "
"MultiIndex objects, respectively."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 ``expand=True``，Series 和 Index 调用者分别返回 DataFrame 和 "
"MultiIndex 对象。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.split:61
msgid ""
"Use of `regex =False` with a `pat` as a compiled regex will raise an "
"error."
msgstr "将 `regex=False` 与编译的正则表达式 `pat` 一起使用将引发错误。"

